  overview="What Use Are Flowers? is a short play for television by Lorraine Hansberry, published after her death in Les Blancs: The Collected Last Plays (1972), described by the Gale entry as a fable about an ageing hermit who tries to pass on his memories of a lost civilisation to children in a ravaged world.",
